    {
      "id": "3It8_e0BBZw5ok7_k4lo5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": -3301.3379871477287,
      "width": 1665.5,
      "height": 1215,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vtEvynYXB1DfsChfrBplF",
        "RB_DFRVZHQm5cNRllz_vh",
        "LGlL96ATJ2KpZV3zxyKhR",
        "1HGtfJluD6_EcjllbuoPO",
        "9BfC1IcaimDGpUDG9SU3j"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bq5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1617833811,
      "version": 1278,
      "versionNonce": 313344868,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "LELegYNgwTPcPUVamLIhD",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "LEj4u3gWzFXJUe9nj3Hfx",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1793702328056,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> Decoder-only Inference :\n\n        ° GPT-like Models are decoder-only models\n\n        ° No Encoder, No Encoder-Decoder Multi-Head Attention\n\n\n\n        ° Input Processing ( aka PREFILL ) : hightly Parallel\n\n                - Inputs ( the tokenized prompt ) are embedded and encoded\n                \n                - Multi-Head Attention computes the keys and values ( KV )\n\n                - Large Matrix Mulitplication, High Usage of the Hardware Accelerator\n\n\n\n        ° Output Generation : Sequential\n\n                - The answer is generated ONE TOKEN at a time\n\n                - Each generated Token is APPENDED to the previous input\n\n                - The process is reated until the Stopping criteria is met ( Max. Length or EOS )\n\n                - Low usage of the hardware Accelerator",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> Decoder-only Inference :\n\n        ° GPT-like Models are decoder-only models\n\n        ° No Encoder, No Encoder-Decoder Multi-Head Attention\n\n\n\n        ° Input Processing ( aka PREFILL ) : hightly Parallel\n\n                - Inputs ( the tokenized prompt ) are embedded and encoded\n                \n                - Multi-Head Attention computes the keys and values ( KV )\n\n                - Large Matrix Mulitplication, High Usage of the Hardware Accelerator\n\n\n\n        ° Output Generation : Sequential\n\n                - The answer is generated ONE TOKEN at a time\n\n                - Each generated Token is APPENDED to the previous input\n\n                - The process is reated until the Stopping criteria is met ( Max. Length or EOS )\n\n                - Low usage of the hardware Accelerator",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": 1793532284134,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
