      "text": "==> We need  to optimize\n\n    ° The first thing we can optimize is the KV Cache",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "==> We need  to optimize\n\n    ° The first thing we can optimize is the KV Cache",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": 1793532284137,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QbU6AlWHmYa3lLAg-WXho",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": -1001.3379871477287,
      "width": 1704.4166259765625,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "P4Mq-a22TGK5GTacaBhy8",
        "sN1xeiNA9UJuGly_r8zKe",
        "1HGtfJluD6_EcjllbuoPO",
        "9BfC1IcaimDGpUDG9SU3j"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 529568403,
      "version": 993,
      "versionNonce": 384982756,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793702328057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> the KV Cache :\n\n        °  We can avoid recomputing KV values again and again for the Input Tokens \n\n        ° We only really need to do it for the Token we just generated and appended to the input\n\n        ° The KV cache stores the KV for all previous tokens in the Accelerator RAM",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> the KV Cache :\n\n        °  We can avoid recomputing KV values again and again for the Input Tokens \n\n        ° We only really need to do it for the Token we just generated and appended to the input\n\n        ° The KV cache stores the KV for all previous tokens in the Accelerator RAM",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": 1793532284137,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
