      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° vLLM revolutionizes servig\n\n° Uses PageAttention technique\n\n° Faster Model loading\n\n° Efficient KV Cache Management\n\n° Reduces Memory fragmentation\n\n° Supports more concurrent users",
