      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793532333250,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° PagedAttention :\n\n        ==> Computes Attention efficiently on non-contiguous blocks \n\n\n° Block Manager :\n\n        ==> Allocates and frees memory blocks as requests evolve\n\n\n° Scheduler :\n\n        ==> Implements Continuous Batching to keep the GPU busy \n\n\n° KV Cache Manager :\n\n        ==> Tracks ownership and sharing ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° PagedAttention :\n\n        ==> Computes Attention efficiently on non-contiguous blocks \n\n\n° Block Manager :\n\n        ==> Allocates and frees memory blocks as requests evolve\n\n\n° Scheduler :\n\n        ==> Implements Continuous Batching to keep the GPU busy \n\n\n° KV Cache Manager :\n\n        ==> Tracks ownership and sharing ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
