      "updated": 1793532368291,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° What you get :\n\n\n        ==> Near-zero Memory Waste\n\n        ==> 2 - 4 x more Throughput\n\n        ==> Same GPU, serve 4x more users\n\n        ==> Enable Continuous Batching",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° What you get :\n\n\n        ==> Near-zero Memory Waste\n\n        ==> 2 - 4 x more Throughput\n\n        ==> Same GPU, serve 4x more users\n\n        ==> Enable Continuous Batching",
