      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Is the model copied to the local drive ( e.g. S3 ) ?\n\n° Is the model in an OCI Image, and the OCI image needs to be downloaded ?\n\n° Is the model stored in a network device ( i.e. URI -- PVC ) and is mounted ?\n\n° Are the model files access with a Read-Only Mode ( faster ) ?",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° Is the model copied to the local drive ( e.g. S3 ) ?\n\n° Is the model in an OCI Image, and the OCI image needs to be downloaded ?\n\n° Is the model stored in a network device ( i.e. URI -- PVC ) and is mounted ?\n\n° Are the model files access with a Read-Only Mode ( faster ) ?",
